{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And you shall bring near.</b> He has already mentioned this. Now the meaning is: when you bring near the bull, Aaron and his sons shall lean their hands upon it. Some say the meaning of וסמך is Aaron alone, and afterward his sons. And concerning the ram it is written וסמכו אהרן ובניו (Exodus 29:15) — now the meaning is, since they were to lean their hands together, not one before the other."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:03.049136448Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}